{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Redux-style state management for SwiftUI, with macros for observability and ready-made plugins for persistence, undo, paywalls, version killswitches, and parental gates.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"Swidux-logo"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swidux is a Redux-style state-management library for SwiftUI. State lives in one observable store, mutations go through reducers, and side effects run as async effects. Macros generate the observability boilerplate. Built-in plugins handle persistence and undo\/redo. Optional plugins ship ready-made paywalls (RevenueCat or StoreKit-shaped), version killswitches, parental gates, analytics (Mixpanel or any backend), feature flags, and SwiftData\/iCloud persistence."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The dispatch cycle:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["View → store.send(.action)","  → willReduce hooks (UndoPlugin snapshots here)","  → reducer mutates state in place, optionally returns Effect","  → plugin reducers handle their own actions","  → afterReduce hooks (PersistencePlugin drains EntityStore changelogs here)","  → observer tree updates only changed properties (per-property observation)","  → effects run on a background actor; results dispatch back via @MainActor send"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your domain types and database stay in your app. Swidux provides the contracts, observability, and dispatch loop."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Companion-Packages","level":2,"text":"Companion Packages","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Vendor-specific adapters live in their own repositories so a third-party SDK never enters the core dependency graph. Each ships a drop-in service conformer plus a preview mock, and publishes its own DocC reference:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — RevenueCat adapter for the paywall plugin ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MockRevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":", and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"},{"type":"text","text":" sheet). See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAPaywall","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginPaywallReference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Mixpanel adapter for the analytics plugin ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":"). See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAnalytics","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginAnalyticsReference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"Swidux","role":"collection","symbolKind":"module","title":"Swidux"},"kind":"symb